00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:45.612
The [inaudible],,
work around this.

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:49.682
The real genius is this chunk
of smoldering termite nest.

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:52.986
Oh, yeah.

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:53.820
Smoky.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:54.421
Smoky.

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:55.388
Smoky.

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:00.627
We're going to
make lots of smoke.

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:04.264
And what the smoke does is
it messes with the bees'

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.732
chemical communication.

00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:09.669
It basically inhibits those
bees, their pheromone, that

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:11.204
tells the whole hive to attack.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.074
Oh, yeah that's red.

