00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:30.623
[inaudible]

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:31.591
Yes.

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:37.597
Alan is busy
chopping away, getting

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:39.265
at the center of the hive.

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:41.234
This is a hollowed out log.

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:44.137
And they're living right
in the middle of it.

00:01:44.204 --> 00:01:48.441
Wild honey provides a vital
source of sweet energy.

00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:51.578
